# open-strings: open strings, low to high, each ringing into the next (no mute gap)
# Drafted from the recording (onset detection + autocorrelation pitch); confirmed by the bassist.
# 0.0-5.2 s: faint G2 ringing at about -70 dBFS before playing; must stay below the noise gate.
timing_tolerance 0.1
cents_tolerance 20

6.36 8.30 E1
8.34 10.70 A1
10.73 13.65 D2
13.68 17.09 G2
